// What the construction of MIR reports about a body the checker accepted: an integer literal
// outside the 31-bit range of the word ([ADR-0018]). The check is about types, and the range of
// `Int` is the representation's business, so the mistake is MIR's to report --- and the body is
// lowered all the same.

